DEVOPS:-
    devops is a combination of development & operation (dev & ops)
    it is a set of practise ,tools & culture that helps software development
    & IT operations team work together to build , test, deploy, & maintain aplliaction & more reliably.

Devops lifecycle:-
    DEV:- 
       1)plan 
       2)code
       3)build
       4)test

    OPS:-
       1)release 
       2)deploy
       3)operate
       4)monitor

BENEFITS:-
      faster deployment
      reduced error
      better security
      improved security
      high availabilty of application
